# PERSONAL PORTFOLIO WEBSITE

This is my personal portfolio website built using HTML and CSS to showcase my profile, skills, education, and projects.

# Features
- Home page with introduction
- About Me section
- Education details
- Skills overview
- Projects showcase
- Contact information

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (basic)
- GitHub Pages

## Features
- Home page with introduction
- About Me section
- Education details
- Skills overview
- Projects showcase
- Contact information

## What I Learned
- Structuring multi-page websites
- Using CSS Flexbox for layouts
- Reusing a single CSS file across pages
- Hosting a static website using GitHub Pages

